  "body": "Porting from https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=24137\r\n\r\nThe original worry is twofold:\r\n\r\n- There may be something which aborts ongoing fetches when a document gets discarded/navigated/otherwise killed\r\n- There are tasks queued by fetching, including keepalive-fetching, which will fail to run because step 1 of the event loop processing model does not run any tasks associated with non-fully-active documents\r\n\r\nThe second one in particular seems likely to still be broken.",
